<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mostly down.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mostly down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spring wheat basis values were mostly lower on Thursday in line with weaker MGE futures and scant farmer sales in several parts of the Northern Plains, dealers said.</p>
<p>MGE May futures ended off 3-1/4 cents at $3.97-1/2 a bushel.</p>
<p>&quot;We had a little bit of truck stuff,&quot; a Minnesota dealer said. But in North Dakota a storm dumped several inches of snow which hampered movement, a dealer there said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a quiet day, nothing happened,&quot; a Montana merchandiser said.  </p>
